# docker-compose.override.yml — task별 포트 스코프
# tasks.sh new 가 자동 생성. 사람이 수동 수정하지 않는다 (덮어쓰기됨).

services:
  web:
    ports:
      - "${WEB_PORT}:3000"
    environment:
      - NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=/api

  api:
    ports:
      - "${API_PORT}:4000"
    environment:
      - DB_HOST=db
      - DB_PORT=3306
      - CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:${WEB_PORT}

  db:
    ports:
      - "${DB_PORT}:3306"
    volumes:
      - task_${TASK_ID}_mysql:/var/lib/mysql

volumes:
  task_${TASK_ID}_mysql:
